161→            <span class="area-name">Performance Optimization &amp; Debugging</span>
162→            <span class="area-count">~12 sessions</span>
163→          </div>
164→          <div class="area-desc">Significant effort on diagnosing and fixing performance bottlenecks including a 3.3s PostCommit issue, 20s hook overhead, CLI hanging at 200% CPU, and JSONL parsing improvements. Claude was used to trace code paths, implement fixes with TDD, add instrumentation/spans, and iteratively refine a perf CLI tool. This was a high-impact area with essential outcomes.</div>
165→        </div>
