167→        <div class="project-area">
168→          <div class="area-header">
169→            <span class="area-name">Code Review &amp; PR Workflow</span>
170→            <span class="area-count">~25 sessions</span>
171→          </div>
172→          <div class="area-desc">The most frequent activity, involving branch-scoped code reviews (sometimes across 100+ files using sub-agents), generating PR descriptions, addressing reviewer feedback, and pushing fixes. Claude read diffs, identified issues, provided structured review reports, and implemented fixes based on review comments. Some friction occurred with scope confusion on large branches and GitHub token permission limitations.</div>
173→        </div>
